('4062f743-338c-5292-9524-cfd3605ca4a6','8c60c532-de7e-53f5-acb1-17b34df44501',1,'part','بخش','spoken & written','one part or feature of a whole system, plan, piece of work etc, especially one that is basic or important',null,null,'عنصر، جزء؛ اقلیم (هوا)؛ رده (شیمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an important element This one fact is the most important element of the theory.','a major element (= very important ) Private study is a major element of the students’ timetable.','a key element (= very important and necessary ) Trust is a key element in any relationship.','a crucial/critical element (= extremely important and necessary ) The most crucial element of our economic system is the law of supply and demand.','a vital/essential element (= necessary so that something can happen or exist ) Her determination is a vital element of her success.','the main element (= most important ) The reform programme has three main elements.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Honesty is a vital element of her success.","translation":"صداقت عنصر حیاتی موفقیت اوست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629602.mp3"},{"sentence":"the primary element in the country’s economy","translation":"عنصر اولیه در اقتصاد کشور","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629605.mp3"},{"sentence":"Besides ability, the other essential element in political success is luck.","translation":"علاوه بر توانایی، عنصر ضروری دیگر در موفقیت سیاسی، شانس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629608.mp3"},{"sentence":"Business and management elements are built into the course.","translation":"عناصر کسب و کار و مدیریت در دوره تعبیه شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001629609.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
