('0c25268c-49f3-5a3c-b4a9-caf156084086','70a7a88c-51ae-5160-bcef-9a4f943fd21d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give someone the official right to do or have something',null,null,'حق دادن (رسمی)؛ لایق دانستن؛ نام‌گذاری (کتاب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Full-time employees are entitled to receive health insurance.","translation":"کارکنان تمام وقت حق دریافت بیمه درمانی را دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625767.mp3"},{"sentence":"Membership entitles you to the monthly journal.","translation":"عضویت به شما حق داشتن مجله ماهانه را می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625770.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7e87a134-ff46-5456-b556-91ff70046520','70a7a88c-51ae-5160-bcef-9a4f943fd21d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be entitled something','حق دادن (رسمی)؛ لایق دانستن؛ نام‌گذاری (کتاب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ada8932e-c981-5a6d-8e84-a9469028033c','76729379-64a8-56ab-864c-35596307a9ee',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to the same degree or amount','[ +adj/adverb ]',null,'به‌طور برابر، یکسان؛ همان‌طور','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You must have a good education, but practical training is equally important.","translation":"شما باید تحصیلات خوبی داشته باشید، اما آموزش عملی به همان اندازه مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501298.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bd353a1e-4b53-5c18-8750-858cd42246a9','76729379-64a8-56ab-864c-35596307a9ee',2,null,null,'spoken & written','in equal parts or amounts',null,null,'در قسمت ها یا مقادیر مساوی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We agreed to divide the money equally between everyone.","translation":"ما توافق کردیم که پول را به طور مساوی بین همه تقسیم کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501302.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4d666c4e-b1bd-5f9f-945d-f308d0e63e21','76729379-64a8-56ab-864c-35596307a9ee',3,null,null,'spoken & written','used when introducing a second idea or statement that is as important as your first one','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'هنگام معرفی یک ایده یا عبارت دوم که به اندازه ایده اول شما مهم است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We want the economy to grow, but equally we want low inflation.","translation":"ما می خواهیم اقتصاد رشد کند، اما به همان اندازه خواهان تورم پایین هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501307.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9d0d63c3-d12e-52a4-bf36-850b416401b9','9f310e53-941c-51ba-9c34-88d2658cffed',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the early part of the night between the end of the day and the time you go to bed','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'عصر، غروب، شامگاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['Monday/Friday/Sunday etc evening They were due to leave on Sunday evening.','tomorrow evening Would you like to come over tomorrow evening?','yesterday evening The robbery took place yesterday evening around nine o''clock.','this evening (= today, in the evening ) I''ll phone you this evening.','early evening (= the early part of the evening ) We met for a drink in the early evening.','late evening (= the later part of the evening ) By the time we arrived, it was late evening.','a spring/summer etc evening On a summer evening, the streets are full of people.','a fine/warm/cool etc evening It was a fine evening, so we decide to eat outside.','in the evening We met up again later in the evening.','in the evenings (= every evening ) I used to get so bored in the evenings, I just ended up watching TV.','during the evening Later, during the evening, fighting broke out near the palace.','for the evening Her parents had gone out for the evening.','on Monday/Friday/Sunday etc evenings (= every Monday, Friday etc. ) We usually meet up for a drink on Friday evenings.','spend an evening (= use an evening doing a particular thing ) He spent many evenings alone in his room.','an evening meal I was just preparing the evening meal when the phone rang.','the evening news (= the main radio or television news programme in the evening ) There was a report about the fire on the evening news.','an evening newspaper/paper I bought an evening newspaper to read on my way home.','the evening rush hour (= the busy time in the evening when a lot of people are travelling home from work ) There''s always congestion on the motorways during the evening rush hour.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I do most of my studying in the evening .","translation":"بیشتر مطالعه ام را عصرها انجام می دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223031.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m usually out on Friday evenings .","translation":"من معمولاً عصرهای جمعه بیرون هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643028.mp3"},{"sentence":"What are you doing tomorrow evening ?","translation":"فردا عصر چیکار میکنی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643021.mp3"},{"sentence":"Peter left yesterday evening .","translation":"پیتر دیروز عصر رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971291.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll see you this evening .","translation":"امروز عصر میبینمت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643015.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was early evening by the time we got home.","translation":"اوایل غروب بود که به خانه رسیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223037.mp3"},{"sentence":"We had just finished our evening meal when the doorbell rang.","translation":"تازه ناهارمان را تمام کرده بودیم که زنگ خانه به صدا درآمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643029.mp3"},{"sentence":"a broadcast on the evening news","translation":"پخش در اخبار عصر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001971301.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('def993be-7bf7-51f9-b10c-7259d1a0d31e','9f310e53-941c-51ba-9c34-88d2658cffed',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a social event that takes place in the evening','[ countable ]',null,'یک رویداد اجتماعی که در شب رخ می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a musical evening","translation":"یک شب موزیکال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643030.mp3"},{"sentence":"an evening of music and poetry","translation":"یک شب موسیقی و شعر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643031.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('278c99a1-b703-5b8a-a939-340c9a7325fe','9f310e53-941c-51ba-9c34-88d2658cffed',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'good evening','عصر، غروب، شامگاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a3af0f14-f00d-5624-96ba-55a168c33e54','413ab903-d285-50bd-aadc-d2cbf539fa48',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to greet someone when you meet them in the evening',null,null,'وقتی عصر با کسی ملاقات می کردی سلام می کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Evening, Joe. Everything all right?","translation":"عصر، جو. همه چیز خوب است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223056.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cce0d204-9755-5d97-ba8b-da17a804d0f1','1aee39b2-ada9-5764-b76a-4b808dfacb98',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used when emphasizing that something is no more and no less than a number or amount , or is completely correct in every detail',null,null,'دقیقاً، تماماً؛ درست (تأیید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s exactly half past five.","translation":"ساعت دقیقا پنج و نیم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224257.mp3"},{"sentence":"The figures may not be exactly right, but they’re close enough.","translation":"ممکن است ارقام دقیقاً درست نباشند، اما به اندازه کافی نزدیک هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734787.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t remember exactly what she said.","translation":"دقیقا یادم نمیاد چی گفت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734790.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a tragic situation and no one will ever know exactly what happened.","translation":"این یک وضعیت غم انگیز است و هیچ کس هرگز نمی داند دقیقا چه اتفاقی افتاده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734791.mp3"},{"sentence":"Where exactly did you stay in Portugal?","translation":"دقیقا کجا در پرتغال اقامت داشتید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734794.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('368346f7-5211-569c-bcad-de06dcbedcda','1aee39b2-ada9-5764-b76a-4b808dfacb98',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize that something is the same or different',null,null,'برای تأکید بر یکسان یا متفاوت بودن چیزی استفاده می شود',array['precisely']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s exactly what we’ve been trying to tell you.","translation":"این دقیقاً همان چیزی است که ما سعی کرده ایم به شما بگوییم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224266.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s exactly the kind of work I’ve been looking for.","translation":"این دقیقاً همان کاری است که من دنبالش بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734795.mp3"},{"sentence":"She tries to be exactly like her older sister.","translation":"او سعی می کند دقیقاً شبیه خواهر بزرگترش باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734796.mp3"},{"sentence":"Kevin’s teachers saw him as quiet and serious, but with his friends he was exactly the opposite .","translation":"معلمان کوین او را ساکت و جدی می دیدند، اما با دوستانش دقیقا برعکس بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734800.mp3"},{"sentence":"The two candidates responded to the question in exactly the same way.","translation":"دو نامزد دقیقاً به این سؤال پاسخ دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734804.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('6ec97e74-d1d4-59bd-9828-dc9178a0a255','1aee39b2-ada9-5764-b76a-4b808dfacb98',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'not exactly','دقیقاً، تماماً؛ درست (تأیید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('cd7e1a5b-a01e-5659-907a-4746a0cd57d9','1aee39b2-ada9-5764-b76a-4b808dfacb98',4,null,null,'spoken','used as a reply to show that you think what someone has said is completely correct or true',null,null,'به عنوان پاسخ استفاده می شود تا نشان دهد که شما فکر می کنید آنچه کسی گفته است کاملاً صحیح یا درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘So you think we should sell the house?’ ‘Exactly.’","translation":"«پس فکر می‌کنی باید خانه را بفروشیم؟» «دقیقاً.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224271.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('34ff2709-96bc-5b46-bc81-487f965e95a8','a18af4a1-24e1-5f98-8933-cd0de4873049',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to look at something carefully and thoroughly because you want to find out more about it',null,null,'وارسی کردن، بررسی کردن (با دقت)؛ معاینه کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A team of divers was sent down to examine the wreck.","translation":"تیمی از غواصان برای بررسی غرق شده به پایین فرستاده شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734891.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hegel’s philosophy will be examined in detail in Chapter 4.","translation":"فلسفه هگل در فصل چهارم به تفصیل مورد بررسی قرار خواهد گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734892.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the course, we will examine how and why Spain became a democracy in 1931.","translation":"در این دوره به بررسی چگونگی و چرایی تبدیل شدن اسپانیا به دموکراسی در سال 1931 خواهیم پرداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734895.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police will have to examine the weapon for fingerprints.","translation":"پلیس باید اسلحه را از نظر اثر انگشت بررسی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224478.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had a look at the car but I couldn’t see anything wrong with it.","translation":"نگاهی به ماشین انداختم اما هیچ مشکلی در آن ندیدم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('9e0abde4-d688-5b95-a8c2-6ed707475f59','a18af4a1-24e1-5f98-8933-cd0de4873049',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a doctor examines you, they look at your body to check that you are healthy',null,null,'اگر پزشک شما را معاینه کند، بدن شما را بررسی می کند تا سلامت شما را بررسی کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('08626b77-ede1-593e-88bb-c265fe2d3892','a18af4a1-24e1-5f98-8933-cd0de4873049',3,null,null,'formal','to ask someone questions to test their knowledge of a subject',null,null,'سوال پرسیدن از کسی برای آزمایش دانش او در مورد یک موضوع',array['test']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You will be examined on American history.","translation":"شما در مورد تاریخ آمریکا مورد بررسی قرار خواهید گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224490.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cbf7d54a-b314-5f17-93df-1613231e8b83','a18af4a1-24e1-5f98-8933-cd0de4873049',4,null,null,'law','to officially ask someone questions in a court of law',null,'cross-examine','به طور رسمی در دادگاه از کسی سؤال بپرسید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0a5f7a01-d3fa-5e83-8435-c09823ebfc03','114ba650-7917-5bd0-83f7-40becbb152e6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a specific fact , idea, person, or thing that is used to explain or support a general idea, or to show what is typical of a larger group',null,null,'نمونه، مثال؛ سرمشق؛ جریمه (عقوبت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good/typical example This painting is a good example of his early work.','a fine/excellent example The house is a fine example of a medieval building.','an outstanding example (= extremely good ) The garden is one of the most outstanding examples of traditional Japanese garden design.','a classic/perfect/prime example (= very typical ) This is a classic example of how not to run a business. The pot is a perfect example of the Marine Style. This is a prime example of government incompetence.','an obvious example Our climate is changing at an alarming rate. The melting of the polar ice caps is an obvious example of this.','a blatant/glaring example (= very obvious and very bad ) His case is a blatant example of the unfairness of the current system.','an extreme example To give you an extreme example, one lady called the police fifteen times in a single evening.','a notable example formal (= important and worth mentioning ) Some places contain a huge variety of animal and plant life. The two most notable examples are tropical forests and coral reefs.','a graphic example (= very clear and full of unpleasant details ) The film is full of graphic examples of what can go wrong if the proper safety procedures are not followed.','give (somebody) an example Let me give you an example of how this might happen.','provide an example Our brochure provides examples of the different villas on offer.','take an example (= consider it or talk about it ) Let’s take the example of a family with two school-age children.','use an example He used several examples to illustrate his point.','cite an example (= mention an example ) The report cites the example of Sweden, where there is a complete ban on advertising on children''s television.','find an example We found examples of people being overcharged by as much as 50%.','contain/include an example The exhibition also contains some examples of his book illustrations.','an example shows/illustrates something These examples show how the disease can be passed on to humans.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can anyone give me an example of a transitive verb?","translation":"آیا کسی می تواند برای من مثالی از فعل متعدی ارائه دهد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734902.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('65fb2794-52bf-5fbe-a6eb-bc9fe166a35e','114ba650-7917-5bd0-83f7-40becbb152e6',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'for example','نمونه، مثال؛ سرمشق؛ جریمه (عقوبت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('75646e0f-276a-5c94-b482-0f4524f41702','114ba650-7917-5bd0-83f7-40becbb152e6',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone whose behaviour is very good and should be copied by others, or this type of behaviour',null,null,'کسی که رفتارش خیلی خوب است و دیگران باید از آن کپی کنند یا این نوع رفتار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her courage is an example to us all.","translation":"شجاعت او نمونه ای برای همه ماست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734924.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents should set an example for their children.","translation":"والدین باید برای فرزندان خود الگو باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734925.mp3"},{"sentence":"I suggest you follow Rosie’s example (= copy her behaviour ) and start doing regular exercise.","translation":"به شما پیشنهاد می‌کنم از الگوی رزی پیروی کنید (= رفتار او را کپی کنید) و ورزش منظم را شروع کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001225186.mp3"},{"sentence":"The team captain leads by example .","translation":"کاپیتان تیم با مثال رهبری می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734935.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s a shining example (= a very good example ) of what a mother should be.","translation":"او یک نمونه درخشان (= نمونه بسیار خوب) از آنچه یک مادر باید باشد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734939.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('b9b9733a-f170-5365-a40b-c8e0505ebb99','114ba650-7917-5bd0-83f7-40becbb152e6',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'make an example of somebody','نمونه، مثال؛ سرمشق؛ جریمه (عقوبت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('233f99e6-bb48-5515-8075-94ddb0696f37','d3444110-b46b-5480-bcca-df82e8954de2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to deliberately not include something',null,null,'مستثنا کردن، کنار گذاشتن (از فهرست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a special diet that excludes dairy products","translation":"یک رژیم غذایی خاص که محصولات لبنی را حذف می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001227021.mp3"},{"sentence":"The judges decided to exclude evidence which had been unfairly obtained.","translation":"قضات تصمیم گرفتند شواهدی را که به طور غیرمنصفانه به دست آمده بود حذف کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040055.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the data was specifically excluded from the report.","translation":"برخی از داده ها به طور خاص از گزارش حذف شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001227024.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some information was left out of the report.","translation":"برخی از اطلاعات در گزارش حذف شد.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"We didn’t mean to leave you out .","translation":"ما قصد نداشتیم شما را کنار بگذاریم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('7bb94236-18b2-53f5-9c5c-96eb6424af67','d3444110-b46b-5480-bcca-df82e8954de2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to not allow someone to take part in something or not allow them to enter a place, especially in a way that seems wrong or unfair',null,null,'اجازه ندادن کسی در کاری شرکت کند یا به او اجازه ورود به مکانی را نمی دهد، به خصوص به شکلی که اشتباه یا ناعادلانه به نظر می رسد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a mainstream exhibition that excluded women artists","translation":"یک نمایشگاه اصلی که زنان هنرمند را کنار گذاشت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735183.mp3"},{"sentence":"The press had been deliberately excluded from the event.","translation":"مطبوعات عمداً از این رویداد کنار گذاشته شده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001227033.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sarah heard the other girls talking and laughing and felt excluded.","translation":"سارا صحبت و خندیدن دخترهای دیگر را شنید و احساس طرد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735186.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ed72b662-74c4-5d84-8738-1a2c525af633','d3444110-b46b-5480-bcca-df82e8954de2',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially make a child leave their school because of their bad behaviour',null,null,'رسماً یک کودک را به دلیل رفتار بدشان ترک مدرسه کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4351ce82-3cfc-5110-a1d5-856ca39c9760','d3444110-b46b-5480-bcca-df82e8954de2',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to decide that something is not a possibility',null,null,'تصمیم گرفتن که چیزی امکان پذیر نیست',array['rule out']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Social workers have excluded sexual abuse as a reason for the child’s disappearance.","translation":"مددکاران اجتماعی آزار جنسی را به عنوان دلیلی برای ناپدید شدن کودک کنار گذاشته اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001227041.mp3"},{"sentence":"At this stage we cannot entirely exclude the possibility of staff cuts.","translation":"در این مرحله ما نمی توانیم به طور کامل احتمال کاهش کارکنان را رد کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001227044.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1eaab331-025d-5062-adc0-ea4a77670fd7','8127b3b9-5828-5d79-919f-e6927dc5dd2e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the amount of money that you spend on something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'هزینه، مخارج؛ مصرف (وقت/هزینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the extra/additional expense Is it worth the extra expense to get a room with a sea view?','an unnecessary expense Paying extra for leather seats seemed like an unnecessary expense.','living expenses (= money that you spend on rent, food, and things such as electricity, gas etc ) She receives £80 a week, from which she must pay for all her living expenses.','operating expenses (= money that a company spends on running its business ) We must reduce our operating expenses.','legal/medical expenses We had to get a loan to pay for my husband’s medical expenses. The tenant can incur considerable legal expenses.','household expenses (= money spent looking after a house and the people in it ) Unfortunately, household expenses don’t go away just because you’re in hospital or out of work.','funeral expenses (= the cost of arranging a funeral ) She had a small insurance policy to cover the funeral expenses.','at great/huge/considerable/vast expense (= used when saying that something costs a lot of money ) The tiles were imported at great expense from Italy. Recently, and at vast expense to the taxpayer, the bridge was rebuilt.','at your own expense (= used when saying that you pay for something yourself ) He had copies of the book printed at his own expense.','at (the) public expense (= paid for by the public through taxes ) The bridge was built at public expense.','go to the expense of doing something (= do something that costs a lot of money ) The council must now decide whether to go to the expense of appealing through the courts.','spare no expense (in doing something) (= spend a lot of money to buy the best things ) Her parents spared no expense in arranging the wedding. Everything has been provided tonight – no expense has been spared!','incur an expense formal (= have to pay for something ) Potential buyers incur the expense of a survey and legal fees.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He borrowed £150,000 and used the money for legal expenses.","translation":"او 150000 پوند وام گرفت و از این پول برای هزینه های قانونی استفاده کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653778.mp3"},{"sentence":"Conference rooms were equipped at great expense.","translation":"اتاق های کنفرانس با هزینه های زیادی تجهیز شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233181.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8d4c0308-1287-5b8c-b10f-9c5d17d61829','8127b3b9-5828-5d79-919f-e6927dc5dd2e',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'expenses','هزینه، مخارج؛ مصرف (وقت/هزینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a94b49d2-a1eb-5d82-ac3d-285ef5e7ec08','8127b3b9-5828-5d79-919f-e6927dc5dd2e',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'at the expense of somebody/something','هزینه، مخارج؛ مصرف (وقت/هزینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bf4bc224-428a-56a0-80a8-c3fefc056b3f','8127b3b9-5828-5d79-919f-e6927dc5dd2e',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'at somebody’s expense','هزینه، مخارج؛ مصرف (وقت/هزینه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
