('ed3e3783-d870-58ec-8d5e-64002f1c5527','fa9a15d7-4383-53b1-9330-3792e30ace76',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to shape or make something, using your hands or only a few tools',null,null,'برای شکل دادن یا ساختن چیزی، با استفاده از دستان خود یا فقط چند ابزار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He fashioned a box from a few old pieces of wood.","translation":"او از چند تکه چوب قدیمی جعبه ای ساخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001213032.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jamie could take a piece of wood and fashion it into a wonderful work of art.","translation":"جیمی می‌توانست یک تکه چوب بگیرد و آن را به یک اثر هنری شگفت‌انگیز تبدیل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001641940.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('99fe42ae-c8b8-5bd4-bfae-cafa85693411','fa9a15d7-4383-53b1-9330-3792e30ace76',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to influence and form someone’s ideas and opinions',null,null,'تحت تاثیر قرار دادن و شکل دادن به ایده ها و نظرات کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We are all unique human beings, fashioned by life experiences.","translation":"همه ما انسان های منحصر به فردی هستیم که توسط تجربیات زندگی شکل گرفته ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001213037.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4acde60d-f5d1-51de-adff-7c907602cebc','24713e9b-af66-5433-bafd-32f7bac3f618',1,null,null,'spoken & written','like something, or in the way that a particular group of people does something',null,null,'مانند چیزی، یا به روشی که گروه خاصی از مردم کاری را انجام می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They ate Indian-fashion, using their fingers.","translation":"آنها با استفاده از انگشتان خود از مد هندی می خوردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001212926.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('faa5293e-3cef-5412-a5f3-df0a427c7f83','9aec1106-037c-58ac-99dd-1840b4788873',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of something that you notice because it seems important, interesting , or typical',null,null,'ویژگی، مشخصه؛ مطلب ویژه (روزنامه)؛ سکانس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a common feature Pine trees are a common feature of the Swedish landscape.','a striking feature (= an unusual or interesting feature ) Her long blonde hair is her most striking feature.','a distinguishing feature (= one that makes something different from others of the same type ) A long beak is one of the bird’s distinguishing features.','a unique feature (= a feature which only one thing has ) A unique feature of this guitar is its shape.','an unusual feature The church’s most unusual feature is this window.','a standard feature (= a normal or usual feature ) Airbags are now a standard feature on most cars.','a regular feature (= one that happens often or a lot ) Delays and cancellations are a regular feature of air travel.','a recurring feature (= one that happens again and again ) Humour is a recurring feature of her novels.','an important feature The final-year project is an important feature of all undergraduate courses.','a significant feature (= one that has an important effect ) Bad weather was a significant feature in the accident.','a central feature (= an important feature ) Cultural diversity is a central feature of modern British society.','a key feature (= a very important or necessary feature ) Private ownership is a key feature of capitalism.','the main feature The main feature of the square is the Gothic cathedral.','an attractive feature The house had many attractive features, notably the large garden.','a design feature (= a detail of the way something has been designed ) The building incorporates many interesting design features.','a safety feature The car has more safety features than its rivals in the same price range.','a redeeming feature (= one that makes something acceptable ) The hotel’s only redeeming feature was its view of the bay']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Air bags are a standard feature in most new cars.","translation":"کیسه هوا یک ویژگی استاندارد در اکثر خودروهای جدید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001238060.mp3"},{"sentence":"An important feature of Van Gogh’s paintings is their bright colours.","translation":"یکی از ویژگی های مهم نقاشی های ون گوگ رنگ های روشن آنهاست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001238063.mp3"},{"sentence":"Striped tails are a common feature of many animals.","translation":"دم راه راه یکی از ویژگی های مشترک بسیاری از حیوانات است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001238066.mp3"},{"sentence":"The hotel’s only redeeming features (= things that make it acceptable ) were that it was cheap and near the city centre.","translation":"تنها ویژگی‌های مفید هتل (= چیزهایی که آن را قابل قبول می‌کند) ارزان بودن و نزدیک به مرکز شهر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644039.mp3"},{"sentence":"The most distinctive feature of the dinosaurs was their size.","translation":"بارزترین ویژگی دایناسورها اندازه آنها بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644046.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the distinguishing features (= features that are different from other things of the same sort ) of modern banking is its dependence on computers.","translation":"یکی از ویژگی‌های متمایز (= ویژگی‌های متفاوت با سایر موارد مشابه) بانکداری مدرن، وابستگی آن به رایانه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644050.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('05ac72e0-55bf-544e-8248-d46839f9b31d','9aec1106-037c-58ac-99dd-1840b4788873',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of writing about a subject in a newspaper or a magazine , or a special report on television or on the radio',null,null,'یک قطعه نوشته درباره موضوعی در روزنامه یا مجله یا گزارش ویژه در تلویزیون یا رادیو','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a common feature Pine trees are a common feature of the Swedish landscape.','a striking feature (= an unusual or interesting feature ) Her long blonde hair is her most striking feature.','a distinguishing feature (= one that makes something different from others of the same type ) A long beak is one of the bird’s distinguishing features.','a unique feature (= a feature which only one thing has ) A unique feature of this guitar is its shape.','an unusual feature The church’s most unusual feature is this window.','a standard feature (= a normal or usual feature ) Airbags are now a standard feature on most cars.','a regular feature (= one that happens often or a lot ) Delays and cancellations are a regular feature of air travel.','a recurring feature (= one that happens again and again ) Humour is a recurring feature of her novels.','an important feature The final-year project is an important feature of all undergraduate courses.','a significant feature (= one that has an important effect ) Bad weather was a significant feature in the accident.','a central feature (= an important feature ) Cultural diversity is a central feature of modern British society.','a key feature (= a very important or necessary feature ) Private ownership is a key feature of capitalism.','the main feature The main feature of the square is the Gothic cathedral.','an attractive feature The house had many attractive features, notably the large garden.','a design feature (= a detail of the way something has been designed ) The building incorporates many interesting design features.','a safety feature The car has more safety features than its rivals in the same price range.','a redeeming feature (= one that makes something acceptable ) The hotel’s only redeeming feature was its view of the bay']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a feature on holidaying with your dog","translation":"یک ویژگی در تعطیلات با سگ شما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001238075.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
