) The hotel’s only redeeming feature was its view of the bay']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He had fine delicate features.","translation":"او ویژگی های ظریف خوبی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001238081.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her eyes were her best feature.","translation":"چشمانش بهترین ویژگی او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644051.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
