l’s only redeeming feature was its view of the bay']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hedges are an important feature of the landscape in Britain.","translation":"پرچین ها یکی از ویژگی های مهم منظره در بریتانیا هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644055.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
