('5c296f14-b9a4-506f-b7a1-7cf3cbb2f82d','ffbbca8d-3e7d-5a41-adf0-ab5211f24174',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in/within somebody’s hearing','شنوایی، حس شنیدن؛ نشست (دادگاه)؛ جلسه رسیدگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have good/bad etc hearing Dogs have excellent hearing.','lose your hearing (= become unable to hear ) He lost his hearing as a child after suffering scarlet fever.','affect/impair your hearing (= make your hearing worse ) Listening to loud music will eventually impair your hearing.','somebody''s hearing gets worse ( also somebody''s hearing deteriorates ) The medication seemed to make her hearing get worse.','somebody''s hearing goes (= someone becomes unable to hear ) His hearing has gone in one ear.','good/sharp/acute My hearing isn''t as good as it used to be. Owls and other predatory birds have very acute hearing.','bad/poor Poor hearing can affect your social relationships.','impaired (= having problems with hearing ) There are about 11,000 people in the UK whose sight and hearing are both severely impaired.','normal He was born with normal hearing but became deaf at the age of 11.','hearing loss Many older people suffer from some degree of hearing loss.','a hearing problem/difficulty/impairment a special telephone for people with hearing problems','be hard of hearing (= not be able to hear well ) The subtitling service is intended for people who are hard of hearing.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bfb8c02a-cc23-5846-af47-a760142182f0','62338fc3-b0a4-538a-90c9-7156bdde8469',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a system for making a room or building warm',null,null,'گرمایش، سیستم گرمایی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have heating The house didn''t have any heating when we moved in.','have the heating on (= use the heating ) It''s getting colder, but we haven''t had the heating on yet.','leave the heating on (= continue to use the heating ) I don''t like to leave the heating on at night.','put/switch/turn the heating on Why don''t you put the heating on if you''re cold?','switch/turn the heating off We turn the heating off before bed.','turn the heating down/up Can you turn the heating down a bit?','the heating comes on The heating comes on at six.','the heating goes off The heating goes off automatically when the room is warm enough.','solar heating (= heating powered by the sun ) They''ve installed solar heating in the new house.','underfloor heating Underfloor heating is popular in bathrooms.','a heating system The gas leak was caused by a faulty heating system.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('97ab8410-91af-5b8c-a033-019e2b87f17e','db078b12-0724-5e0f-a585-a6e114f5a2fe',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in large amounts, to a high degree , or with great severity',null,null,'به‌شدت، سنگین؛ مکرراً (باران)',array['very']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I became heavily involved in politics.","translation":"من به شدت درگیر سیاست شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734332.mp3"},{"sentence":"The report was heavily criticized in the press.","translation":"این گزارش به شدت در مطبوعات مورد انتقاد قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734336.mp3"},{"sentence":"a heavily populated area","translation":"یک منطقه پرجمعیت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734348.mp3"},{"sentence":"thousands of heavily armed troops","translation":"هزاران سرباز به شدت مسلح","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734340.mp3"},{"sentence":"His wife was heavily pregnant at the time.","translation":"همسرش در آن زمان به شدت باردار بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734344.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s been raining heavily all day.","translation":"تمام روز باران شدیدی می بارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001352347.mp3"},{"sentence":"Paul was drinking heavily by then.","translation":"پل در آن زمان به شدت مشروب می خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001352350.mp3"},{"sentence":"Britain is heavily dependent on imports for its raw materials.","translation":"بریتانیا برای مواد خام خود به شدت به واردات وابسته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734331.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
