('ca9d12e9-5541-57e4-992d-aa94a93fc282','a7213320-55bc-591e-b254-6fa263fb9483',1,'past events','رویدادهای گذشته','spoken & written','all the things that happened in the past, especially the political, social, or economic development of a nation','[ uncountable ]',null,'تاریخ، گذشته؛ تاریخ (رشته)؛ شرح گذشته (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['recent/modern/contemporary history The country’s recent history is powerfully told in this film.','early/ancient history He had studied ancient Roman history.','recorded history (= history since people have written things down ) These were the worst floods in recorded history.','local history (= the history of events in a particular local area ) The building is now a museum of local history.','American/Chinese/British etc history It was one of the worst peacetime disasters in American history.','human history (= the history of people rather than the world itself ) World War I was the most destructive war in human history up to that time.','political/social etc history the political history of Germany','oral history (= history that is told by speaking and that often consists of personal memories ) Smith recorded the conversation for oral history.','rich history (= an interesting and important history ) Greece has a very rich history.','long history The 1970s were the most successful in the theatre''s long history.','history shows/tells (that) History shows that the usual response to violent protests is repression.','go down in history (= be remembered for many years ) She will go down in history as one of the greatest tennis players of all time.','make history (= do something important that will be recorded and remembered ) Ordinary Berliners made history when they tore down the wall.','rewrite history (= change what we believe are the facts about the past ) They''re trying to rewrite history to exaggerate their role in the war.','trace the history of something (= find out what the history of something is ) James traces the history of modern cricket back to its beginnings in the late 1700s.','shape history (= influence events that are recorded ) He is one of the politicians who shaped 20th century history.','a period of/in history a glorious period in English history','the first time in history (= the first time something has ever happened ) For the first time in history, an American president resigned his office.','change the course of history (= do something that has many important effects ) Roosevelt and Churchill helped to change the course of history.','be steeped in history (= be closely connected with important events in history ) Cambridge is steeped in history and tradition.','consign something to the dustbin of history (= to forget about something that existed in the past – used especially when saying that you will feel glad when people have got rid of something ) One day nuclear weapons will be consigned to the dustbin of history.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Throughout history the achievements of women have been largely ignored.","translation":"در طول تاریخ، دستاوردهای زنان تا حد زیادی نادیده گرفته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967743.mp3"},{"sentence":"the post-war history of Europe","translation":"تاریخ اروپا پس از جنگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967748.mp3"},{"sentence":"No man in recent history has done more to rebuild the Democratic Party.","translation":"هیچ مردی در تاریخ اخیر بیشتر برای بازسازی حزب دمکرات انجام نداده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967749.mp3"},{"sentence":"the early history of Scotland","translation":"تاریخ اولیه اسکاتلند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967753.mp3"},{"sentence":"Other meteor storms have occurred in recorded history .","translation":"طوفان های شهاب سنگ دیگری نیز در تاریخ ثبت شده رخ داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967757.mp3"},{"sentence":"a museum devoted to local history","translation":"موزه ای که به تاریخ محلی اختصاص دارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967761.mp3"},{"sentence":"one of the darkest episodes in American history","translation":"یکی از تاریک ترین اپیزودهای تاریخ آمریکا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967764.mp3"},{"sentence":"an interesting period in Egyptian history","translation":"دوره جالبی در تاریخ مصر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967767.mp3"},{"sentence":"a decision that changed the course of history","translation":"تصمیمی که مسیر تاریخ را تغییر داد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967772.mp3"},{"sentence":"a college steeped in history","translation":"یک کالج غرق در تاریخ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967775.mp3"},{"sentence":"History shows that the usual response to violent protest is repression.","translation":"تاریخ نشان می دهد که واکنش معمول به اعتراض خشونت آمیز، سرکوب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967778.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('2d647e9e-d887-5422-80a9-f7b09d2bb957','a7213320-55bc-591e-b254-6fa263fb9483',2,'development of something','توسعه چیزی','spoken & written','the events that took place from the beginning and during the development of a particular place, activity, institution etc','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'رویدادهایی که از ابتدا و در طول توسعه یک مکان، فعالیت، موسسه خاص و غیره رخ داده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['recent/modern/contemporary history The country’s recent history is powerfully told in this film.','early/ancient history He had studied ancient Roman history.','recorded history (= history since people have written things down ) These were the worst floods in recorded history.','local history (= the history of events in a particular local area ) The building is now a museum of local history.','American/Chinese/British etc history It was one of the worst peacetime disasters in American history.','human history (= the history of people rather than the world itself ) World War I was the most destructive war in human history up to that time.','political/social etc history the political history of Germany','oral history (= history that is told by speaking and that often consists of personal memories ) Smith recorded the conversation for oral history.','rich history (= an interesting and important history ) Greece has a very rich history.','long history The 1970s were the most successful in the theatre''s long history.','history shows/tells (that) History shows that the usual response to violent protests is repression.','go down in history (= be remembered for many years ) She will go down in history as one of the greatest tennis players of all time.','make history (= do something important that will be recorded and remembered ) Ordinary Berliners made history when they tore down the wall.','rewrite history (= change what we believe are the facts about the past ) They''re trying to rewrite history to exaggerate their role in the war.','trace the history of something (= find out what the history of something is ) James traces the history of modern cricket back to its beginnings in the late 1700s.','shape history (= influence events that are recorded ) He is one of the politicians who shaped 20th century history.','a period of/in history a glorious period in English history','the first time in history (= the first time something has ever happened ) For the first time in history, an American president resigned his office.','change the course of history (= do something that has many important effects ) Roosevelt and Churchill helped to change the course of history.','be steeped in history (= be closely connected with important events in history ) Cambridge is steeped in history and tradition.','consign something to the dustbin of history (= to forget about something that existed in the past – used especially when saying that you will feel glad when people have got rid of something ) One day nuclear weapons will be consigned to the dustbin of history.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the worst disaster in the history of space travel","translation":"بدترین فاجعه در تاریخ سفرهای فضایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001385040.mp3"},{"sentence":"The 1970s were the most successful in the theater’s long history.","translation":"دهه 1970 موفق ترین در تاریخ طولانی تئاتر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727080.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
