('f2b2cc2c-4067-566d-aa14-00fdb429dcca','15d79230-71ec-5da6-94ec-27323911489b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something which a person owns, especially land or share s in a company',null,null,'دارایی، سهام (شرکت)؛ نگه‌داری (دشت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The government has decided to sell its 21% holding in the firm.","translation":"دولت تصمیم گرفته است 21 درصد سهام خود را در این شرکت بفروشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001807388.mp3"},{"sentence":"companies with large property holdings","translation":"شرکت هایی با دارایی های بزرگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002091578.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e504249b-4829-50b9-a111-615dd601ee68','1b169e27-76a7-5467-b4b1-8671ffbcb83c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a time of rest from work, school etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تعطیلات، مرخصی؛ سفر تعطیلات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on holiday The children were excited about going on holiday.','have/take a holiday Teachers cannot take holidays during term time.','book a holiday I booked the holiday online.','a skiing/camping/walking etc holiday They went on a camping holiday in France.','a package holiday (= a holiday in which you pay a price that includes travel, room, and food ) The company organizes package holidays to Spain and Greece.','a summer holiday They were going to a house on the coast for their summer holidays.','a winter holiday Why not try a winter holiday for a change?','a family holiday I first visited Orkney on a family holiday when I was a boy.','an annual holiday (= a holiday you take every year ) We were getting ready for our annual holiday in Cornwall.','your dream holiday (= the best holiday you can imagine ) They won a dream holiday for two to the Caribbean.','a holiday resort (= a place with many hotels where a lot of people go on holiday ) a holiday resort in Spain','a holiday destination (= a town or country where a lot of people go on holiday ) Marmaris is one of Turkey''s most popular holiday destinations.','a holiday brochure (= a magazine that shows what holidays you can take ) We were looking through holiday brochures thinking about the summer.','holiday photos ( also holiday snaps informal ) (= photographs that you take when you are on holiday ) Do you want to see our holiday snaps?','a holiday romance (= a brief romantic relationship with someone you meet on holiday ) It was just a holiday romance; I never saw him again.','a holiday abroad (= a holiday in a country other than the one you live in ) They were planning a holiday abroad that year.','the holiday of a lifetime (= a very good or expensive holiday that you will only take once ) We took the family on a holiday of a lifetime to Orlando, Florida.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The school holidays start tomorrow.","translation":"تعطیلات مدارس از فردا شروع می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000784.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m away on holiday until the 1st of June.","translation":"من تا اول ژوئن در تعطیلات هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739170.mp3"},{"sentence":"He came to stay with us in the school holidays.","translation":"او آمد تا در تعطیلات مدرسه پیش ما بماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000785.mp3"},{"sentence":"a holiday from her usual responsibilities","translation":"یک تعطیلی از مسئولیت های معمولش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000786.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Where’s Kate?’ ‘She’s off this week.’","translation":"«کیت کجاست؟» «این هفته می‌رود.»","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('20d8a3d0-f6f0-59b1-9e0e-1cdeb79df63b','1b169e27-76a7-5467-b4b1-8671ffbcb83c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a period of time when you travel to another place for pleasure','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'دوره زمانی که برای تفریح ​​به مکان دیگری سفر می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go on holiday The children were excited about going on holiday.','have/take a holiday Teachers cannot take holidays during term time.','book a holiday I booked the holiday online.','a skiing/camping/walking etc holiday They went on a camping holiday in France.','a package holiday (= a holiday in which you pay a price that includes travel, room, and food ) The company organizes package holidays to Spain and Greece.','a summer holiday They were going to a house on the coast for their summer holidays.','a winter holiday Why not try a winter holiday for a change?','a family holiday I first visited Orkney on a family holiday when I was a boy.','an annual holiday (= a holiday you take every year ) We were getting ready for our annual holiday in Cornwall.','your dream holiday (= the best holiday you can imagine ) They won a dream holiday for two to the Caribbean.','a holiday resort (= a place with many hotels where a lot of people go on holiday ) a holiday resort in Spain','a holiday destination (= a town or country where a lot of people go on holiday ) Marmaris is one of Turkey''s most popular holiday destinations.','a holiday brochure (= a magazine that shows what holidays you can take ) We were looking through holiday brochures thinking about the summer.','holiday photos ( also holiday snaps informal ) (= photographs that you take when you are on holiday ) Do you want to see our holiday snaps?','a holiday romance (= a brief romantic relationship with someone you meet on holiday ) It was just a holiday romance; I never saw him again.','a holiday abroad (= a holiday in a country other than the one you live in ) They were planning a holiday abroad that year.','the holiday of a lifetime (= a very good or expensive holiday that you will only take once ) We took the family on a holiday of a lifetime to Orlando, Florida.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re going to Spain for our holidays.","translation":"ما برای تعطیلات به اسپانیا می رویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967854.mp3"},{"sentence":"He caught malaria while on holiday in Africa.","translation":"او در تعطیلات در آفریقا به مالاریا مبتلا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967855.mp3"},{"sentence":"I haven’t had a proper holiday for two years.","translation":"من دو سال است که تعطیلات مناسبی نداشته ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000787.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('afa5485e-0c5c-5f74-bfd1-11dbdd29c4e2','1b169e27-76a7-5467-b4b1-8671ffbcb83c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a day fixed by law on which people do not have to go to work or school','[ countable ]',null,'روزی که توسط قانون تعیین شده است که در آن مردم مجبور نیستند به سر کار یا مدرسه بروند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The 4th of July is a national holiday in the US.","translation":"4 جولای یک تعطیلات ملی در ایالات متحده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001739195.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
