('283e2fb9-f105-5646-b5e0-ee2bfe8e6795','57bfbc4e-b125-5afb-b593-d9c66269366d',1,null,null,'formal','to be very careful in the way you use your money, supplies etc and not waste any',null,null,'در نحوه استفاده از پول، لوازم و غیره خود بسیار مراقب باشید و هیچ چیز را هدر ندهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('08a5b0b9-2d91-59c1-83b0-fe61412cefc0','32fdacb4-d365-513b-983d-711f4ef5e441',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to describe the way you would like things to be, even though this may not be possible','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'در وضع ایده‌آل، مطلوباً؛ (خواسته) در بهترین حالت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Ideally, your car should have high-security locks.","translation":"در حالت ایده آل، خودروی شما باید دارای قفل های با امنیت بالا باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001398170.mp3"},{"sentence":"Fruit and vegetables should ideally be organically grown.","translation":"میوه ها و سبزیجات به طور ایده آل باید به صورت ارگانیک رشد کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001398171.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d690a1d4-c446-59ca-be8e-9992c339346d','32fdacb4-d365-513b-983d-711f4ef5e441',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'ideally suited/placed/situated etc','در وضع ایده‌آل، مطلوباً؛ (خواسته) در بهترین حالت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('06960b23-5621-5868-a672-2ec16ce80e0f','26635c18-4675-52f1-ac49-5d50b5c3a273',1,null,null,'spoken & written','not allowed by the law',null,null,'غیرقانونی، غیرمجاز؛ بی‌قید (تیر)',array['unlawful']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['completely/totally illegal The deal was completely illegal.','highly illegal (= completely illegal ) It all sounds highly illegal.','strictly illegal formal (= completely illegal – used for emphasis ) Phone tapping is strictly illegal.','technically illegal (= according to the exact details of a law ) This type of boxing, although technically illegal, remained popular until the 1880s.','be illegal It is illegal to sell tobacco products to anyone under the age of 16.','become illegal The drug did not become illegal until the 1970s.','make something illegal He was involved in the campaign to make hunting illegal.','declare something illegal The strike was declared illegal on July 7.','an illegal weapon He was charged with carrying an illegal weapon.','illegal drugs She was found guilty of possession of illegal drugs.','an illegal substance (= an illegal drug ) Customs officials found an illegal substance in Smith’s luggage.','illegal parking/gambling/hunting etc The fines for illegal parking are likely to increase.','illegal immigrants An estimated seven million illegal immigrants are brought into Europe each year.','illegal activities They were suspected of being involved in illegal activities.','an illegal act Driving without insurance is an illegal act.','illegal use of something They were found guilty of the illegal use of confidential information.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"illegal drugs","translation":"مواد مخدر غیر قانونی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001400677.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were involved in illegal activities.","translation":"آنها درگیر فعالیت های غیرقانونی بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020098.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is illegal to sell tobacco to someone under 16.","translation":"فروش تنباکو به افراد زیر 16 سال غیرقانونی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750435.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is against the law to have a gun without a licence.","translation":"داشتن اسلحه بدون گواهینامه خلاف قانون است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('3db20c0f-774f-54b2-8661-57cc4b6a26a5','676be8b4-0162-56d4-a957-a2b322c16489',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an illegal immigrant',null,null,'یک مهاجر غیرقانونی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Illegals are still slipping through in unacceptable numbers.","translation":"غیرقانونی ها هنوز به تعداد غیرقابل قبولی در حال لغزش هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001400702.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('225b6f74-c90e-5ac6-8e8d-9b6cc0f67e1e','64b3aa5e-e341-5e03-8c46-af3743316fba',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a disease of the body or mind , or the condition of being ill',null,null,'بیماری، مرض؛ بیم (روانی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an illness When did you first find out that you had the illness?','suffer from an illness She suffers from a rare illness.','get/develop an illness She developed the illness when she was in her 50s.','contract an illness formal (= get an illness by catching it from another person ) He contracted the illness while he was working abroad.','recover from an illness It took several months for him to recover from his illness.','be diagnosed with an illness (= be found by doctors to have an illness ) Her husband had just been diagnosed with a terminal illness.','cause/lead to illness Inadequate hygiene can lead to illness.','prevent illness Vaccines have been successful in preventing illness.','serious/severe His illness is more severe than the doctors first thought.','minor (= not serious ) He suffered a succession of minor illnesses.','fatal (= causing death quite quickly ) She developed a fatal illness.','life-threatening (= likely to cause death ) Doctors say that his illness isn’t life-threatening.','terminal (= causing death eventually, and not possible to cure ) At that point the illness was thought to be terminal.','incurable (= not possible to cure ) The films tells the sad story of a young boy with an incurable illness.','acute (= becoming serious very quickly ) A lot of illnesses can be either acute or chronic.','chronic (= that lasts a long time, and cannot be cured ) Diabetes is an example of a chronic illness.','a long/short illness She nursed him through his long illness. Arthur died following a short illness.','a debilitating illness (= that makes you very weak ) His last years were ruined by a debilitating illness.','a childhood illness Measles is a common childhood illness.','a mental/psychiatric illness We provide specialist care for young people with mental illnesses.','the symptoms of an illness Symptoms of the illness include vomiting and severe headaches.','a period of illness He returned to work after a period of illness.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She had all the normal childhood illnesses.","translation":"او تمام بیماری های عادی دوران کودکی را داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001400961.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her mother was recovering from a serious illness.","translation":"مادرش در حال بهبودی از یک بیماری سخت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000816.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve never missed a day’s work through illness.","translation":"من هرگز یک روز کار را به دلیل بیماری از دست نداده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000817.mp3"},{"sentence":"ways to improve your health and reduce the risk of illness","translation":"راه هایی برای بهبود سلامت و کاهش خطر ابتلا به بیماری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000818.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('0c2bd9b2-e5b3-5880-9a76-ea3af4d2d246','a026dc61-92fb-5489-8742-e237205521ca',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to form a picture or idea in your mind about what something could be like',null,null,'تصور کردن، خیال کردن؛ فرض کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be easy to imagine It’s easy to imagine how the change in the law caused a lot of confusion.','be hard/difficult to imagine It’s hard to imagine the suffering she must have gone through.','can easily imagine I can easily imagine how frightening the accident must have been.','can well imagine (= can easily imagine ) I can well imagine how delighted you were with the news.','can hardly/scarcely imagine (= find it difficult to imagine ) He could scarcely imagine what living in such poor conditions must have been like.','can’t/couldn’t imagine He couldn’t imagine life without his wife.','what somebody had imagined (= what someone thought something would be like, before they saw it or experienced it ) The office was not what he had imagined.','be bigger/smaller/worse etc than you had imagined The job interview proved to be much worse than I had imagined it would be.','let us imagine … (= used to encourage someone else to think about a possibility ) Let us imagine that you are an employer who wants to recruit some new staff.','somebody is imagining things (= someone has a false or wrong idea about something ) She’s imagining things if she thinks she has a chance of winning the prize.','naively imagine (= to imagine something without realizing how complicated the situation is ) She had naively imagined that marriage would solve all her problems.','fondly imagine (= to believe something that is untrue ) He had fondly imagined that she was in love with him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Imagine that you have just won a million pounds.","translation":"تصور کنید که به تازگی یک میلیون پوند برنده شده اید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719082.mp3"},{"sentence":"Imagine life without hot water.","translation":"زندگی بدون آب گرم را تصور کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402532.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you imagine what it’s like when it’s really hot out here in Delhi?","translation":"آیا می توانید تصور کنید که وقتی اینجا در دهلی واقعا گرم است چگونه است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402535.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could imagine dark-robed figures moving silently along the stone corridors.","translation":"او می‌توانست چهره‌هایی با لباس‌های تیره را تصور کند که بی‌صدا در راهروهای سنگی حرکت می‌کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402538.mp3"},{"sentence":"Imagine doing a horrible job like that!","translation":"تصور کنید که چنین کار وحشتناکی انجام می دهید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402541.mp3"},{"sentence":"Just imagine going all that way for nothing!","translation":"فقط تصور کنید که این همه راه را برای هیچ!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719089.mp3"},{"sentence":"He didn’t quite dare to imagine himself as a real artist.","translation":"او جرات نداشت خود را به عنوان یک هنرمند واقعی تصور کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402544.mp3"},{"sentence":"Somehow, I can’t imagine him without a beard.","translation":"به نوعی، نمی توانم او را بدون ریش تصور کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402547.mp3"},{"sentence":"After such a dry summer, it’s difficult to imagine what rain looks like.","translation":"پس از چنین تابستان خشک، تصور اینکه باران چگونه به نظر می رسد دشوار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719096.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t imagine living without music.","translation":"نمی توانم زندگی بدون موسیقی را تصور کنم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,10),
('8350f421-914c-53ac-b340-036a567ab382','a026dc61-92fb-5489-8742-e237205521ca',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to have a false or wrong idea about something',null,null,'داشتن تصور نادرست یا اشتباه در مورد چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Perhaps she’d never really been there at all – perhaps she’d just imagined it.","translation":"شاید او واقعاً هرگز آنجا نبوده است - شاید فقط تصورش را کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402552.mp3"},{"sentence":"imagined dangers","translation":"خطرات را تصور کرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402553.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had imagined that the doctor would be male.","translation":"او تصور می کرد که دکتر مرد باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402556.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was surprised when I saw the farm. I had imagined it would be much bigger.","translation":"وقتی مزرعه را دیدم تعجب کردم. تصور می کردم خیلی بزرگتر باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402559.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s nobody here. You’re just imagining things .","translation":"اینجا کسی نیست شما فقط چیزهایی را تصور می کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719104.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('809ee674-9f83-5af6-8814-b4f4ab9e50f3','a026dc61-92fb-5489-8742-e237205521ca',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that something is true or may happen , but without being sure or having proof','[ not in progressive ]',null,'فکر کردن به اینکه چیزی درست است یا ممکن است اتفاق بیفتد، اما بدون اطمینان یا داشتن مدرک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘A very complicated subject, I imagine, ’ said Edwin.","translation":"ادوین گفت: فکر می کنم موضوع بسیار پیچیده ای است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402565.mp3"},{"sentence":"You are obviously tired and I imagine that nothing would make you admit it.","translation":"شما مشخصا خسته هستید و من تصور می کنم که هیچ چیز شما را مجبور به اعتراف نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001402568.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('afe513a8-b65f-5d15-8cb2-941c3bdb6352','a026dc61-92fb-5489-8742-e237205521ca',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'you can/can’t imagine something','تصور کردن، خیال کردن؛ فرض کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('00c670e7-e782-5d7a-b7a3-8ffe3d7d7025','d74d785e-8d0a-504a-bb86-65214aecc4e9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make someone feel admiration and respect','[ not in progressive ]',null,'جلب توجه کردن، ماندگار کردن (تأثیر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Steve borrowed his dad’s sports car to impress his girlfriend.","translation":"استیو ماشین اسپرت پدرش را قرض گرفت تا دوست دخترش را تحت تاثیر قرار دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001408263.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were very impressed by the standard of work.","translation":"ما بسیار تحت تاثیر استاندارد کار قرار گرفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709605.mp3"},{"sentence":"One candidate in particular impressed us with her knowledge.","translation":"یکی از نامزدها به طور خاص ما را با دانش خود تحت تأثیر قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709606.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think the chief exec was favourably impressed by your presentation.","translation":"من فکر می کنم که مدیر اجرایی از ارائه شما تحت تأثیر قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000827.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘He’s a lawyer?’ Mum looked suitably impressed (= as impressed as you would expect ) .","translation":"«او یک وکیل است؟» مامان به‌طور مناسبی تحت‌تأثیر به نظر می‌رسید (= همان‌طور که انتظار دارید تحت تأثیر قرار گرفت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709613.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('557b893c-4eb8-5cf7-880b-21b22b28227d','d74d785e-8d0a-504a-bb86-65214aecc4e9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to make the importance of something clear to someone',null,null,'اهمیت چیزی را برای کسی روشن کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Father impressed on me the value of hard work.","translation":"پدر ارزش کار سخت را بر من تأثیر گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001408278.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fadb21df-491a-54e2-ba94-ed215ee14bd3','d74d785e-8d0a-504a-bb86-65214aecc4e9',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to press something into a soft surface so that a mark or pattern appears on it',null,null,'فشار دادن چیزی روی یک سطح نرم به طوری که علامت یا الگوی روی آن ظاهر شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"patterns impressed in the clay","translation":"الگوهای تحت تأثیر خاک رس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001408284.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d4efb474-42cc-570c-971d-2e2fb8da3fb9','72a2b520-ae76-5c8f-af75-6c8492de8833',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make something better , or to become better','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'بهبود بخشیدن؛ بهبود یافتن؛ بالا بردن (رتبه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a course for students wishing to improve their English","translation":"دوره ای برای دانش آموزانی که مایل به بهبود زبان انگلیسی خود هستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001408971.mp3"},{"sentence":"The doctors say she is improving (= after being ill ) .","translation":"پزشکان می گویند که او در حال بهبود است (= پس از بیماری).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709690.mp3"},{"sentence":"You could use the money for improving your home.","translation":"می توانید از این پول برای بهبود خانه خود استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709694.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many wines improve with age (= get better as they get older ) .","translation":"بسیاری از شراب ها با افزایش سن بهبود می یابند (= با افزایش سن بهتر می شوند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709695.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her English is definitely getting better .","translation":"انگلیسی او قطعا بهتر می شود.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"I hope things get better soon.","translation":"امیدوارم اوضاع به زودی بهتر شود.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,6),
('abc83cde-ddac-5890-ba74-08935e3f14c7','b579d283-44d2-58a3-a17b-0636fe0c9557',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if one thing includes another, the second thing is part of the first',null,null,'شامل شدن، در بر گرفتن؛ حساب کردن (بند)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Does the price include postage?","translation":"آیا قیمت شامل هزینه پست می شود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001370626.mp3"},{"sentence":"His job includes looking after under-21 teams.","translation":"وظیفه او مراقبت از تیم های زیر 21 سال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001726534.mp3"},{"sentence":"The curriculum includes courses in computing.","translation":"برنامه درسی شامل دوره های محاسباتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001370625.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4b392d29-3cc9-518f-8d79-07553985aafa','b579d283-44d2-58a3-a17b-0636fe0c9557',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to make someone or something part of a larger group or set',null,null,'برای اینکه کسی یا چیزی بخشی از یک گروه یا مجموعه بزرگتر باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The team is stronger now they’ve included Roscoe.","translation":"تیم اکنون قوی‌تر شده است و روسکو را در ترکیب خود قرار داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001370635.mp3"},{"sentence":"Service is included in the bill.","translation":"خدمات در صورتحساب گنجانده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001370639.mp3"},{"sentence":"Would you include a mobile phone on your list of essentials?","translation":"آیا تلفن همراه را در لیست لوازم ضروری خود قرار می دهید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00500.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('089c64b9-3f89-59bd-a045-b7d01a554f90','a13c09b7-948c-5b02-bb77-32695719dd05',1,null,null,'spoken & written','happening at the beginning',null,null,'اولیه، آغازین؛ مقدم (نظر)',array['first']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an initial investment of £5,000","translation":"سرمایه گذاری اولیه 5000 پوند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001412935.mp3"},{"sentence":"the initial stages of the disease","translation":"مراحل اولیه بیماری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750747.mp3"},{"sentence":"The initial response has been encouraging.","translation":"واکنش اولیه دلگرم کننده بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750748.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('d9653c97-6bb3-5423-a4ce-eda9b4b1d2a5','63591857-ced1-5c9d-bf02-97cd086a6716',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the first letter of someone’s first name',null,null,'حرف اول نام کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Can I have your initial, Mr Davies?’ ‘It’s G, Mr G Davies.’","translation":"\"آیا می توانم حرف شما را داشته باشم، آقای دیویس؟\" \"این G است، آقای جی دیویس.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001412945.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7cab3b56-37a9-5f4a-9fbb-2125ef5bc388','63591857-ced1-5c9d-bf02-97cd086a6716',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'initials',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('acd32cc1-2aca-5f97-a05d-0f74cf3c9784','a1a55de2-8689-5f59-9752-d5a38ce1a04a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to write your initials on a document to make it official or to show that you agree with something','[ transitive ]',null,'نوشتن حروف اول بر روی یک سند برای رسمی کردن آن یا نشان دادن اینکه با چیزی موافق هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The two countries have initialled a new defence co-operation agreement.","translation":"دو کشور توافقنامه همکاری دفاعی جدیدی را پاراف کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001412969.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('42928474-47af-5979-8fe2-0d65c96c7b48','87ef2fea-3fb6-5e20-af5e-5a70448e826d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a question you ask in order to get information','[ countable ]',null,'پرسش، استعلام؛ رسیدگی (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make an inquiry The police are making inquiries to discover the cause of the accident.','get/have an inquiry (= receive it ) We’ve already had a lot of inquiries about membership of the new sports centre.','receive an inquiry formal: The television station has received several inquiries from viewers requesting a repeat of the programme.','handle/deal with an inquiry Staff will be available to deal with inquiries.','answer an inquiry ( also respond to an inquiry formal ) The government has not yet answered our inquiry.','a general inquiry There is a need for a general inquiry into the train company’s safety standards.','a specific inquiry His job is to answer specific inquiries by individuals or groups.','a written inquiry I submitted a written inquiry to the local council.','a flood/stream of inquiries The special offer has produced a flood of inquiries from interested customers.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re getting a lot of inquiries about our new London–Rio service.","translation":"ما در حال دریافت سوالات زیادی در مورد سرویس جدید لندن-ریو هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001414376.mp3"},{"sentence":"inquiries from potential applicants","translation":"درخواست از متقاضیان بالقوه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751032.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t know who sent the gift, but I’ll make some inquiries .","translation":"من نمی‌دانم چه کسی هدیه را فرستاده است، اما من کمی پرس و جو خواهم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001414379.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ceba9703-6921-5f37-885c-7034588b872a','87ef2fea-3fb6-5e20-af5e-5a70448e826d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act or process of asking questions in order to get information','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل یا فرآیند پرسیدن سوال برای به دست آوردن اطلاعات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"On further inquiry, it emerged that Malcolm had not been involved in the incident.","translation":"در تحقیقات بیشتر، مشخص شد که مالکوم در این حادثه دست نداشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001414388.mp3"},{"sentence":"The local council set up a committee of inquiry to look into policing arrangements.","translation":"شورای محلی یک کمیته تحقیق برای بررسی ترتیبات پلیس راه اندازی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751038.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('da1d5bfd-4f96-5309-99b1-8556fc3214f0','87ef2fea-3fb6-5e20-af5e-5a70448e826d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an official process to find out about something','[ countable ]',null,'یک فرآیند رسمی برای اطلاع از چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a judicial inquiry into the deaths","translation":"تحقیقات قضایی در مورد مرگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751045.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Civil Aviation Authority has agreed to hold an inquiry into the accident.","translation":"سازمان هواپیمایی کشوری با انجام تحقیقات درباره این سانحه موافقت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751048.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police have launched a murder inquiry .","translation":"پلیس تحقیقات قتل را آغاز کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751049.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents have called for an independent inquiry into the accident.","translation":"والدین خواستار تحقیقات مستقل در مورد این حادثه شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751053.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e0597cfb-1d83-5406-bf24-e34ed8c20f91','0fbd13d3-6dae-5731-9442-d8336fe82358',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to put a piece of equipment somewhere and connect it so that it is ready to be used',null,null,'نصب کردن؛ راه‌اندازی کردن (نرم‌افزار)؛ درمیان گذاشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They’ve installed the new computer network at last.","translation":"آنها بالاخره شبکه کامپیوتری جدید را نصب کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416156.mp3"},{"sentence":"Security cameras have been installed in the city centre.","translation":"دوربین های امنیتی در مرکز شهر نصب شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718971.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('78664e37-8b8a-59c8-baab-ca9064f30db9','0fbd13d3-6dae-5731-9442-d8336fe82358',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to add new software to a computer so that it is ready to be used',null,null,'برای افزودن نرم افزار جدید به کامپیوتر به طوری که آماده استفاده باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ve installed new anti-virus software.","translation":"ما نرم افزار آنتی ویروس جدید نصب کرده ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718976.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7bffeb31-6157-5feb-852d-aa12a190061b','0fbd13d3-6dae-5731-9442-d8336fe82358',3,null,null,'formal','to put someone in an important job or position , especially with a ceremony',null,null,'قرار دادن کسی در یک شغل یا موقعیت مهم، مخصوصاً با یک مراسم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Churchill was installed as Chancellor of the university.","translation":"چرچیل به عنوان رئیس دانشگاه منصوب شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416161.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('386f5885-4f86-5f4e-a350-86fcbc89ae57','0fbd13d3-6dae-5731-9442-d8336fe82358',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'install yourself in/at etc','نصب کردن؛ راه‌اندازی کردن (نرم‌افزار)؛ درمیان گذاشتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6fc027f1-d059-5757-b0de-ddead750f268','811069fe-61d3-50f4-b344-4b75efed2ccd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','happening or produced immediately','[ usually before noun ]',null,'فوری، آنی؛ فوری (قابل‌تهیه)',array['immediate']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an instant success","translation":"یک موفقیت آنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718998.mp3"},{"sentence":"a system that provides instant access to client information","translation":"سیستمی که دسترسی فوری به اطلاعات مشتری را فراهم می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416938.mp3"},{"sentence":"The women took an instant dislike to one another.","translation":"زنان بلافاصله نسبت به یکدیگر بیزاری کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416937.mp3"},{"sentence":"The programme brought an instant response.","translation":"این برنامه یک پاسخ فوری به همراه داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718999.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('09000fca-85b3-5444-a2f0-8746b0f9ac22','811069fe-61d3-50f4-b344-4b75efed2ccd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','instant food, coffee etc is in the form of powder and prepared by adding hot water','[ only before noun ]',null,'غذای فوری، قهوه و غیره به صورت پودر و با افزودن آب داغ تهیه می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"instant coffee","translation":"قهوه فوری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416943.mp3"},{"sentence":"instant soup","translation":"سوپ فوری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719000.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('dd638dc2-e12f-51cd-be72-abadebbae572','32509198-155b-5e2b-a6f9-7e843da8242b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a moment','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'یک لحظه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She caught his eye for an instant .","translation":"او برای یک لحظه توجه او را جلب کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416953.mp3"},{"sentence":"When the rain started, the crowd vanished in an instant (= immediately ) .","translation":"وقتی باران شروع شد، جمعیت در یک لحظه (= بلافاصله) ناپدید شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001416957.mp3"},{"sentence":"an instant of panic","translation":"یک لحظه وحشت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719009.mp3"},{"sentence":"She stepped towards the door and, in that very same instant, the doorbell rang.","translation":"به سمت در رفت و در همان لحظه زنگ در به صدا درآمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001719010.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
