he government’s propaganda machine","translation":"ماشین تبلیغاتی حکومت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000171139.mp3"},{"sentence":"the powerful American war machine","translation":"ماشین جنگی قدرتمند آمریکایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752534.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
