,'a summit meeting (= between leaders of governments ) The prime minister is in Paris for a European summit meeting.','a business meeting He had to go into town for a business meeting.','a protest meeting Anti-road campaigners are holding a protest meeting today.','an emergency/urgent meeting The Council has called an emergency meeting to decide what action to take.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had felt drawn to Alice ever since our first meeting.","translation":"از اولین ملاقاتمان احساس می کردم به آلیس کشیده شده بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000220602.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
