('bf3ac186-0a79-57b3-af9e-dd2c2382bd25','cbdd6aaa-0406-588c-962c-4673ebefa513',6,null,null,'spoken & written','an event at which a group of Quakers (= a Christian religious group ) pray together',null,null,'رویدادی که در آن گروهی از کویکرها (= یک گروه مذهبی مسیحی) با هم دعا می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a meeting I had a long meeting with my manager.','hold a meeting formal (= have a meeting ) The meetings are usually held on a Friday.','go to a meeting ( also attend a meeting formal ) All staff members are expected to attend the meeting.','call a meeting ( also convene a meeting formal ) (= arrange a meeting ) The board has the power to convene a general meeting if necessary.','chair a meeting ( also preside over a meeting formal ) (= lead it ) The meeting was chaired by Professor Jones of the University of York.','open a meeting (= begin it ) There was disagreement about opening the meeting with a prayer.','close a meeting (= end it ) He closed the meeting by saying, ‘I think we have made great progress.’','address a meeting (= speak to the people at a meeting ) A member of Greenpeace addressed the protest meeting.','adjourn a meeting (= make it stop for a period of time ) This meeting is adjourned until tomorrow.','a committee/staff/board etc meeting A staff meeting will be held at 3 p.m.','an annual meeting (= an important meeting held once a year ) the annual meeting of the British Medical Association','a monthly/weekly meeting a routine weekly meeting with the managing director','a public/open meeting (= that anyone can go to ) A public meeting was held to discuss the proposal to build a new school.','a general meeting especially British English (= that anyone, or anyone in a particular organization, can go to ) The annual general meeting of the rugby club was held last night.','a private/closed meeting (= that only a few people are allowed to go to ) The senator attended a private meeting with the president.','a summit meeting (= between leaders of governments ) The prime minister is in Paris for a European summit meeting.','a business meeting He had to go into town for a business meeting.','a protest meeting Anti-road campaigners are holding a protest meeting today.','an emergency/urgent meeting The Council has called an emergency meeting to decide what action to take.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('1e23d893-f880-5476-aa62-ee5085954889','f84dd183-86ff-5031-a5a1-f6de400b0a0c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to talk or write about something or someone, usually quickly and without saying very much or giving details',null,null,'اشاره کردن، برشمردن؛ نام بردن (از)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['as I mentioned earlier As I mentioned earlier, it will cost a lot of money.','it is worth mentioning that (= it is important enough to mention ) It is worth mentioning again that most accidents happen in the home.','mention something in passing (= mention something without much detail, especially while you were talking about something else ) She mentioned in passing that she had an eight-year-old son.','now (that) you mention it (= used for saying that you had not thought of something until someone else mentioned it ) I’ve never been to his house either, now that you mention it.','fail/neglect/omit to mention something (= deliberately not mention something ) I omitted to mention that I had not been to university.','forget to mention something I must not forget to mention how kind he was to us.','avoid mentioning something They both avoided mentioning John, though Anne longed to talk about him.','mention somebody’s name Why does he look angry every time I mention Clare’s name?','to mention but a few (= used when you are only giving a few examples ) She had taken a number of classes, including photography, art, and pottery, to mention but a few.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Was my name mentioned at all?","translation":"اصلا اسمم برده شد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222305.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the problems were mentioned in his report.","translation":"در گزارش وی به برخی از مشکلات اشاره شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564239.mp3"},{"sentence":"I mentioned the idea to Joan, and she seemed to like it.","translation":"من این ایده را به جوآن گفتم و به نظر می رسید که او آن را دوست داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222308.mp3"},{"sentence":"He mentioned that he was having problems, but he didn’t explain.","translation":"او اشاره کرد که مشکل دارد، اما توضیحی نداد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222311.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s worth mentioning (= it is important enough to mention ) that they only studied a very small number of cases.","translation":"شایان ذکر است (= به اندازه کافی مهم است که ذکر شود) که آنها فقط تعداد بسیار کمی از موارد را مطالعه کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222315.mp3"},{"sentence":"As I mentioned earlier , there have been a lot of changes recently.","translation":"همانطور که قبلاً اشاره کردم، اخیراً تغییرات زیادی رخ داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564246.mp3"},{"sentence":"She mentioned in passing (= mentioned in a quick unimportant way ) that you had just been to Rome.","translation":"او گذراً اشاره کرد (= به روشی سریع و بی اهمیت ذکر شد) که شما به تازگی به رم رفته اید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564248.mp3"},{"sentence":"Now you mention it, I haven’t seen her around lately.","translation":"حالا شما به آن اشاره کنید، من اخیراً او را در اطراف ندیده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564253.mp3"},{"sentence":"The report failed to mention that most of the landowners do not live on their properties.","translation":"در این گزارش اشاره نشده است که بیشتر مالکان زمین در املاک خود زندگی نمی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817076.mp3"},{"sentence":"He mentioned a book he’d read.","translation":"او به کتابی اشاره کرد که خوانده بود.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"She mentioned that she might be late.","translation":"او اشاره کرد که ممکن است دیر بیاید.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,11),
('f6f7767f-10d1-50be-af68-1e03dbb6d0e4','f84dd183-86ff-5031-a5a1-f6de400b0a0c',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'don’t mention it','اشاره کردن، برشمردن؛ نام بردن (از)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['as I mentioned earlier As I mentioned earlier, it will cost a lot of money.','it is worth mentioning that (= it is important enough to mention ) It is worth mentioning again that most accidents happen in the home.','mention something in passing (= mention something without much detail, especially while you were talking about something else ) She mentioned in passing that she had an eight-year-old son.','now (that) you mention it (= used for saying that you had not thought of something until someone else mentioned it ) I’ve never been to his house either, now that you mention it.','fail/neglect/omit to mention something (= deliberately not mention something ) I omitted to mention that I had not been to university.','forget to mention something I must not forget to mention how kind he was to us.','avoid mentioning something They both avoided mentioning John, though Anne longed to talk about him.','mention somebody’s name Why does he look angry every time I mention Clare’s name?','to mention but a few (= used when you are only giving a few examples ) She had taken a number of classes, including photography, art, and pottery, to mention but a few.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a4278a5c-e54a-5027-a7d7-25066aa6c91d','f84dd183-86ff-5031-a5a1-f6de400b0a0c',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'not to mention something','اشاره کردن، برشمردن؛ نام بردن (از)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['as I mentioned earlier As I mentioned earlier, it will cost a lot of money.','it is worth mentioning that (= it is important enough to mention ) It is worth mentioning again that most accidents happen in the home.','mention something in passing (= mention something without much detail, especially while you were talking about something else ) She mentioned in passing that she had an eight-year-old son.','now (that) you mention it (= used for saying that you had not thought of something until someone else mentioned it ) I’ve never been to his house either, now that you mention it.','fail/neglect/omit to mention something (= deliberately not mention something ) I omitted to mention that I had not been to university.','forget to mention something I must not forget to mention how kind he was to us.','avoid mentioning something They both avoided mentioning John, though Anne longed to talk about him.','mention somebody’s name Why does he look angry every time I mention Clare’s name?','to mention but a few (= used when you are only giving a few examples ) She had taken a number of classes, including photography, art, and pottery, to mention but a few.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8d4a4467-8f8f-5ac1-a94b-195481459d44','f84dd183-86ff-5031-a5a1-f6de400b0a0c',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be mentioned in dispatches','اشاره کردن، برشمردن؛ نام بردن (از)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['as I mentioned earlier As I mentioned earlier, it will cost a lot of money.','it is worth mentioning that (= it is important enough to mention ) It is worth mentioning again that most accidents happen in the home.','mention something in passing (= mention something without much detail, especially while you were talking about something else ) She mentioned in passing that she had an eight-year-old son.','now (that) you mention it (= used for saying that you had not thought of something until someone else mentioned it ) I’ve never been to his house either, now that you mention it.','fail/neglect/omit to mention something (= deliberately not mention something ) I omitted to mention that I had not been to university.','forget to mention something I must not forget to mention how kind he was to us.','avoid mentioning something They both avoided mentioning John, though Anne longed to talk about him.','mention somebody’s name Why does he look angry every time I mention Clare’s name?','to mention but a few (= used when you are only giving a few examples ) She had taken a number of classes, including photography, art, and pottery, to mention but a few.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5b55602b-9341-5ed4-84f8-2c1dd38bb290','077d2afe-5d20-5d74-812d-808fc414d054',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone mentions something or someone in a conversation, piece of writing etc',null,null,'وقتی کسی در مکالمه، نوشته ای و غیره به چیزی یا شخصی اشاره می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make no mention of something Nelson made no mention of his family; he talked only of his work.','get/receive a mention This type of research rarely gets a mention in the media.','deserve/merit a mention The village was large enough to merit a mention in the 11th century Domesday Book.','a brief mention Dillon makes only a brief mention of the idea in his book.','special/particular mention Mrs. McMillan deserves particular mention for all her hard work.','a passing mention (= a brief mention when other things seem more important ) There was only a passing mention of the event in the paper.','be worthy of mention (= deserve to be talked about ) This book is particularly worthy of mention for the clarity of its writing.','the mere mention of something (= the fact of saying something that seems unimportant ) The mere mention of his name caused her to burst into tears.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He made no mention of his wife’s illness.","translation":"او هیچ اشاره ای به بیماری همسرش نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564264.mp3"},{"sentence":"At the mention of a trip to the seaside, the children got very excited.","translation":"با اشاره به سفر به ساحل، بچه ها بسیار هیجان زده شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564272.mp3"},{"sentence":"They all get a mention (= they are all mentioned ) in the book.","translation":"همه آنها در کتاب ذکر شده (= همه آنها ذکر شده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000222792.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is one other person who deserves special mention (= is especially worth mentioning for something they have done ) .","translation":"یک نفر دیگر نیز سزاوار ذکر ویژه است (= به ویژه برای کاری که انجام داده است، شایسته ذکر است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564268.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f3fdf4e6-6190-5a10-b3f7-87eb3283a118','ceabc094-2c6f-5c88-bb04-9ea3f8e6dd0c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a spoken or written piece of information that you send to another person or leave for them',null,null,'پیام، خبر؛ پیام (تلویزیون)؛ پند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['get a message ( also receive a message formal ) Didn’t you get my message?','send a message My mum just sent me a text message.','leave a message (= write or say something that the person will receive later ) Please leave a message after the beep.','take a message (= write down a message from someone for someone else ) Ellen isn’t here. Can I take a message?','give somebody a message (= from someone else ) Just give him the message.','pass on/relay/deliver a message (= give someone a message from someone else ) I asked Rob if he would pass on a message for me.','an urgent/important message an urgent message for the commanding officer','a brief/short message She left a short message on his answering machine.','a personal message It was a personal message from Thomas.','a telephone/phone message (= a message that someone has written down for you from a phone call ) There was a telephone message for her to call Harbury.','a text message (= a written message that you receive on your mobile phone ) Her phone kept beeping whenever she got a text message.','an email/mail message (= a message that you receive by email ) Just send me an email message to let me know what time.','a secret message a secret message written in lemon juice','a message of support/sympathy/congratulations etc Other celebrities sent messages of support.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There’s a message from Karen on the answerphone.","translation":"پیامی از کارن در تلفن وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974216.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have an urgent message for you.","translation":"من یک پیام فوری برای شما دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974219.mp3"},{"sentence":"He left a message saying he would probably be a little late.","translation":"او پیغامی گذاشت و گفت که احتمالاً کمی دیر خواهد آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564512.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bf6f84cf-975e-5b5e-9a1c-0e25a75933e8','ceabc094-2c6f-5c88-bb04-9ea3f8e6dd0c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the main or most important idea that someone is trying to tell people about in a film , book, speech etc','[ usually singular ]',null,'اصلی‌ترین یا مهم‌ترین ایده‌ای که کسی می‌خواهد در یک فیلم، کتاب، سخنرانی و غیره درباره آن به مردم بگوید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['get a message ( also receive a message formal ) Didn’t you get my message?','send a message My mum just sent me a text message.','leave a message (= write or say something that the person will receive later ) Please leave a message after the beep.','take a message (= write down a message from someone for someone else ) Ellen isn’t here. Can I take a message?','give somebody a message (= from someone else ) Just give him the message.','pass on/relay/deliver a message (= give someone a message from someone else ) I asked Rob if he would pass on a message for me.','an urgent/important message an urgent message for the commanding officer','a brief/short message She left a short message on his answering machine.','a personal message It was a personal message from Thomas.','a telephone/phone message (= a message that someone has written down for you from a phone call ) There was a telephone message for her to call Harbury.','a text message (= a written message that you receive on your mobile phone ) Her phone kept beeping whenever she got a text message.','an email/mail message (= a message that you receive by email ) Just send me an email message to let me know what time.','a secret message a secret message written in lemon juice','a message of support/sympathy/congratulations etc Other celebrities sent messages of support.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The message of the film is that good always triumphs over evil.","translation":"پیام فیلم این است که خیر همیشه بر شر پیروز می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000224054.mp3"},{"sentence":"The result of this legal battle sends an important message to people in similar situations.","translation":"نتیجه این نبرد حقوقی پیام مهمی را برای افراد در شرایط مشابه ارسال می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564528.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s perfectly possible to get your message across (= communicate what you want to say ) without being so angry.","translation":"این کاملا امکان پذیر است که پیام خود را بدون عصبانیت برسانید (= آنچه را که می خواهید بگویید) منتقل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001564524.mp3"},{"sentence":"They use illustrations to convey their message .","translation":"آنها از تصاویر برای انتقال پیام خود استفاده می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817113.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
