('464aa9c4-8550-5a33-acdd-5296ed3f529d','cc3d59f4-59e5-5a4f-a05e-ab12890329f5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to send a text message or another electronic message, for example a message on a social networking site',null,null,'برای ارسال یک پیام متنی یا پیام الکترونیکی دیگر، به عنوان مثال یک پیام در یک سایت شبکه اجتماعی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You can message several people at once.","translation":"می توانید همزمان به چند نفر پیام دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c59c7ebd-737c-51cf-a903-5c6d48f597b9','a14c6aa7-5273-5b69-b1f2-9089f54bd4cf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a substance that is formed naturally in the earth , such as coal , salt , stone , or gold . Minerals can be dug out of the ground and used',null,null,'معدنی، کانی؛ آب معدنی؛ ماده معدنی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The area is very rich in minerals .","translation":"این منطقه از نظر مواد معدنی بسیار غنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000199010.mp3"},{"sentence":"a country with few mineral resources","translation":"کشوری با منابع معدنی کم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534435.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1489db86-ddd1-54aa-9984-4703f1cff95a','a14c6aa7-5273-5b69-b1f2-9089f54bd4cf',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a natural substance such as iron that is present in some foods and is important for good health',null,null,'یک ماده طبیعی مانند آهن که در برخی غذاها وجود دارد و برای سلامتی مهم است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Fish is a rich source of vitamins and minerals.","translation":"ماهی منبع غنی از ویتامین ها و مواد معدنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534438.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('89490689-0dde-5def-b3f3-beb6bcc9746c','c22e38b1-f66a-5460-bc40-66542ee15c73',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the minimum number, degree , or amount of something is the smallest or least that is possible , allowed , or needed',null,null,'حداقل، کمینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The minimum number of students we need to run the course is fifteen.","translation":"حداقل تعداد دانشجویی که برای اجرای دوره نیاز داریم پانزده نفر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001753400.mp3"},{"sentence":"The minimum age for retirement is 55.","translation":"حداقل سن برای بازنشستگی 55 سال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001753401.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('23a9a9b2-5b3f-5ef3-96fe-798b283a5088','df064d95-850f-5876-9b22-7c6d10eff6df',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the smallest amount of something or number of things that is possible or necessary',null,null,'کوچکترین مقدار چیزی یا تعداد چیزهایی که ممکن یا ضروری است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a minimum of something Candidates should have a minimum of five years’ work experience.','keep something to a minimum (= to keep something at a low level ) Keep the noise to a minimum, will you?','reduce something to a minimum (= make something less, so it is at a low level ) We want to reduce the environmental impact to a minimum.','need a minimum of something ( also require a minimum of something formal ) We’ll need a minimum of two days to get this ready.','an absolute/bare minimum (= the very least amount ) He paid in five pounds, the bare minimum needed to keep the bank account open.','the legal/statutory minimum (= the least amount the law says you must have ) The wage was often well below the legal minimum.','the required/necessary minimum (= the least amount that you must have ) He received 35 votes, two more than the required minimum.','with a minimum of fuss (= with very little anxious behaviour or activity ) They checked our passports with the minimum of fuss.','with a minimum of effort (= with very little effort ) The house could be restored with a minimum of effort.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The judge recommended that he should serve a minimum of 12 years.","translation":"قاضی توصیه کرد که او باید حداقل 12 سال خدمت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001753407.mp3"},{"sentence":"He achieved enviable results with the minimum of effort.","translation":"او با حداقل تلاش به نتایج غبطه انگیزی دست یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001753408.mp3"},{"sentence":"Prison inmates are kept in tiny cells, with the bare minimum of furniture.","translation":"زندانیان در سلول های کوچک و با حداقل اثاثیه نگهداری می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534514.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had reduced her consumption of fat and sugar to an absolute minimum.","translation":"او مصرف چربی و قند خود را به حداقل مطلق کاهش داده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534515.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('bed76d88-ed7f-5b3d-83f0-264ab5d152d2','df064d95-850f-5876-9b22-7c6d10eff6df',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'at a/the minimum',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a minimum of something Candidates should have a minimum of five years’ work experience.','keep something to a minimum (= to keep something at a low level ) Keep the noise to a minimum, will you?','reduce something to a minimum (= make something less, so it is at a low level ) We want to reduce the environmental impact to a minimum.','need a minimum of something ( also require a minimum of something formal ) We’ll need a minimum of two days to get this ready.','an absolute/bare minimum (= the very least amount ) He paid in five pounds, the bare minimum needed to keep the bank account open.','the legal/statutory minimum (= the least amount the law says you must have ) The wage was often well below the legal minimum.','the required/necessary minimum (= the least amount that you must have ) He received 35 votes, two more than the required minimum.','with a minimum of fuss (= with very little anxious behaviour or activity ) They checked our passports with the minimum of fuss.','with a minimum of effort (= with very little effort ) The house could be restored with a minimum of effort.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e996464c-cffe-59cb-a0e3-0e30b2ee34d8','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',1,'air force/army etc','نیروی هوایی / ارتش و غیره','spoken & written','an important job that involves travelling somewhere, done by a member of the air force , army etc, or by a spacecraft',null,null,'مأموریت، مأموریت (کشور)؛ مأموریت (مذهبی)؛ مأموریت (هوایی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was sent on over 200 missions before being killed in action.","translation":"او قبل از کشته شدن در عملیات به بیش از 200 ماموریت اعزام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000202675.mp3"},{"sentence":"the first manned space mission to Mars","translation":"اولین ماموریت فضایی سرنشین دار به مریخ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000202676.mp3"},{"sentence":"US troops taking part in the peacekeeping mission","translation":"نیروهای آمریکایی که در ماموریت حفظ صلح شرکت می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554579.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('efdc7067-0b17-591b-93fb-1bf9a3f40873','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',2,'job','شغل','spoken & written','an important job that someone has been given to do, especially when they are sent to another place',null,null,'کار مهمی که به کسی محول شده است، به خصوص زمانی که به جای دیگری فرستاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her mission was to improve staff morale.","translation":"ماموریت او بهبود روحیه کارکنان بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000202686.mp3"},{"sentence":"scientists on a mission to the rainforest, to study possible medicinal uses of plants","translation":"دانشمندان در ماموریتی به جنگل های بارانی، برای مطالعه کاربردهای دارویی احتمالی گیاهان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554584.mp3"},{"sentence":"a group of US congressmen on a fact-finding mission to Northern Ireland","translation":"گروهی از نمایندگان کنگره آمریکا در یک ماموریت حقیقت یاب در ایرلند شمالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554587.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f91c9ed0-aa45-5692-a4eb-02299fb6cb1f','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',3,'duty','وظیفه','spoken & written','something that you feel you must do because it is your duty',null,null,'کاری که احساس می کنید باید انجام دهید زیرا وظیفه شماست',array['calling','vocation']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tom’s mission was to help young people in his local community.","translation":"ماموریت تام کمک به جوانان در جامعه محلی خود بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040135.mp3"},{"sentence":"His main mission in life is to earn as much money as possible.","translation":"ماموریت اصلی او در زندگی کسب درآمد هر چه بیشتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0799fc18-9291-55c4-bb55-76c8394c468d','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',4,'purpose','هدف','spoken & written','the purpose or the most important aim of an organization',null,'mission statement','هدف یا مهمترین هدف یک سازمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The mission of International House is to enable students of different cultures to live together and build life-long friendships.","translation":"ماموریت خانه بین المللی این است که دانش آموزان با فرهنگ های مختلف را قادر به زندگی مشترک و ایجاد دوستی های مادام العمر کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763926.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2a9772e5-738f-5092-ac68-5623a4376fbd','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',5,'government','دولت','spoken & written','a group of important people who are sent by their government to another country to discuss something or collect information',null,null,'گروهی از افراد مهم که توسط دولتشان به کشور دیگری فرستاده می شوند تا درباره چیزی بحث کنند یا اطلاعات جمع آوری کنند',array['delegation']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a British trade mission to Moscow","translation":"یک ماموریت تجاری بریتانیا به مسکو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000202681.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bd1d6ab3-64a2-511c-8343-8934cddec5e2','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',6,'religion','دین','spoken & written','religious work that involves going to a foreign country in order to teach people about Christianity or help poor people',null,null,'کار مذهبی که شامل رفتن به یک کشور خارجی به منظور آموزش مسیحیت به مردم یا کمک به مردم فقیر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('357fb2dd-41e4-5edd-8aba-f57219df502b','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'mission accomplished','مأموریت، مأموریت (کشور)؛ مأموریت (مذهبی)؛ مأموریت (هوایی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6db1db5f-af03-5fe6-9659-5b0cab853255','22da589d-453f-58da-b6e0-0504df3a7401',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'woman/man with a mission','مأموریت، مأموریت (کشور)؛ مأموریت (مذهبی)؛ مأموریت (هوایی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7e5c491a-d812-5cdc-95d8-74903bf2eedd','4148b6ed-6803-5998-b3ff-ee37a2012bb9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that has been done in the wrong way, or an opinion or statement that is incorrect','[ countable ]',null,'خطا، اشتباه؛ لغزش (چشم)؛ خطای (محاسبه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a mistake The lab must have made a mistake – this can’t be right.','correct a mistake Luckily I was able to correct the mistake before my boss saw it.','realize your mistake As soon as he realized his mistake he turned in the right direction.','admit your mistake It is better to admit your mistake and apologize.','mistakes happen We’re very careful, but mistakes can happen.','a common mistake A common mistake is to imagine that dogs think like humans.','a little/minor mistake The essay was full of little mistakes.','a serious/grave mistake There was a serious mistake in the instructions.','an honest mistake (= a mistake, and not a deliberate action ) Thomas admitted he had broken the law, but said that it had been an honest mistake.','a silly/stupid mistake You need to be able to laugh at your own silly mistakes.','an easy mistake (to make) She looks like her sister, so it’s an easy mistake to make.','a spelling mistake She spotted two spelling mistakes in the article.','be full of mistakes The article was full of mistakes.','it is a mistake to think/assume etc something It would be a mistake to assume that all snakes are dangerous.','there must be some mistake (= used when you think someone has made a mistake ) There must be some mistake. I definitely booked a room for tonight.','be full of mistakes (= have a lot of mistakes ) The report was full of mistakes.','be all a mistake (= used to say that a situation happened because of a mistake ) He couldn’t bring himself to tell her it was all a mistake.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We may have made a mistake in our calculations.","translation":"ممکن است در محاسبات خود اشتباه کرده باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554614.mp3"},{"sentence":"The most common mistake is to plant them too deep.","translation":"رایج ترین اشتباه این است که آنها را بیش از حد عمیق بکارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001974268.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('578e12c0-a916-53c8-8c14-f2408677b391','4148b6ed-6803-5998-b3ff-ee37a2012bb9',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something you do that is not sensible or has a bad result','[ countable ]',null,'کاری که انجام می دهید معقول نیست یا نتیجه بدی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Buying the house seemed a great idea at the time, but now I can see it was a terrible mistake .","translation":"خرید خانه در آن زمان ایده خوبی به نظر می رسید، اما اکنون می توانم ببینم که این یک اشتباه وحشتناک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001040.mp3"},{"sentence":"Marrying him was the biggest mistake she ever made .","translation":"ازدواج با او بزرگترین اشتباه او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554647.mp3"},{"sentence":"I stupidly made the mistake of giving them my phone number.","translation":"من احمقانه اشتباه کردم که شماره تلفنم را به آنها دادم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000202954.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
