('f5ca8cfb-6e79-5ff6-8f73-0ea28f18fbd2','350b24ed-0c88-59c2-97c2-d0cb2e54c5e3',3,'movement','حرکت','formal','the movement of people or vehicles along a road or across an area of land','[ uncountable ]',null,'حرکت افراد یا وسایل نقلیه در طول یک جاده یا در یک منطقه از زمین','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['narrow A narrow passage led to a small room at the back of the house.','dark He groped his way along the dark passage.','an underground/subterranean passage The air in these underground passages is cold and damp.','a secret passage The bookcase moved to reveal a secret passage.','a maze of passages (= many passages, in which it is easy to get lost ) We wandered through a maze of passages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bridge isn’t strong enough to allow the passage of heavy vehicles.","translation":"این پل به اندازه کافی قوی نیست که اجازه عبور وسایل نقلیه سنگین را بدهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371156.mp3"},{"sentence":"Both sides agreed to allow the free passage of medical supplies into the area.","translation":"هر دو طرف موافقت کردند که اجازه عبور رایگان تجهیزات پزشکی به منطقه را بدهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559390.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was guaranteed safe passage out of the country.","translation":"عبور امن او از کشور تضمین شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559394.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('3e07219e-983c-5f4c-a4a8-80dd077f2a86','350b24ed-0c88-59c2-97c2-d0cb2e54c5e3',4,'of a law','از یک قانون','spoken & written','when a new law is discussed and accepted by a parliament or Congress','[ uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که قانون جدیدی در مجلس یا کنگره مورد بحث و پذیرش قرار می گیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['narrow A narrow passage led to a small room at the back of the house.','dark He groped his way along the dark passage.','an underground/subterranean passage The air in these underground passages is cold and damp.','a secret passage The bookcase moved to reveal a secret passage.','a maze of passages (= many passages, in which it is easy to get lost ) We wandered through a maze of passages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bill was amended several times during its passage through Congress.","translation":"این لایحه در طول تصویب آن در کنگره چندین بار اصلاح شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371149.mp3"},{"sentence":"They are expecting the new legislation to have quite a rough passage (= be discussed and criticized a lot ) through Parliament.","translation":"آنها انتظار دارند که قانون جدید از طریق پارلمان تصویب شود (= مورد بحث و انتقاد فراوان قرار گیرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559398.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
