('ec152381-ff19-5be5-bc36-f1c23b23bdfc','350b24ed-0c88-59c2-97c2-d0cb2e54c5e3',7,'way through','راه از طریق','spoken & written','a way through something','[ singular ]',null,'راهی از طریق چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['narrow A narrow passage led to a small room at the back of the house.','dark He groped his way along the dark passage.','an underground/subterranean passage The air in these underground passages is cold and damp.','a secret passage The bookcase moved to reveal a secret passage.','a maze of passages (= many passages, in which it is easy to get lost ) We wandered through a maze of passages.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police forced a passage through the crowd.","translation":"پلیس به زور از میان جمعیت عبور کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371130.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
