('8a64fb68-b266-5fc8-abc7-b9962d5ac9fb','908c51be-d6c7-5779-8a79-56432e412203',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a very strong feeling of sexual love','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'احساس بسیار قوی عشق جنسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His eyes were burning with passion.","translation":"چشمانش از شوق می سوخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559429.mp3"},{"sentence":"her passion for a married man","translation":"علاقه او به یک مرد متاهل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371387.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cfac233a-cfe1-5d4e-a66e-b481a063d4b0','908c51be-d6c7-5779-8a79-56432e412203',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a very strong belief or feeling about something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'یک باور یا احساس بسیار قوی در مورد چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great passion The orchestra plays with great passion.','strong passions In this area, the issue has already stirred strong passions.','arouse/stir passions (= cause strong feelings in people ) The case aroused passions throughout the country.','passions run high (= people are very excited, angry, or upset ) The judge''s decision is expected today and passions are running high.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He spoke with considerable passion about the importance of art and literature.","translation":"او با شور و شوق قابل توجهی در مورد اهمیت هنر و ادبیات صحبت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559433.mp3"},{"sentence":"The issue arouses strong passions .","translation":"موضوع احساسات شدید را برمی انگیزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559435.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e1f734aa-8866-569c-9f48-5ec3d08b15ba','908c51be-d6c7-5779-8a79-56432e412203',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a very strong liking for something','[ countable ]',null,'علاقه بسیار شدید به چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"his passion for football","translation":"اشتیاق او به فوتبال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000371397.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gardening was her great passion.","translation":"باغبانی اشتیاق بزرگ او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559440.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7265db90-3a79-5767-af66-d82cea2bd68a','908c51be-d6c7-5779-8a79-56432e412203',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'fly into a passion','شور (مسیح)؛ عشق شدید، ولع؛ شور و شوق','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0d8858af-704a-5a83-b9eb-9c8236b2732a','da99fb3d-4284-5d01-8df3-b551c619a38e',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the Passion','شور (مسیح)؛ عشق شدید، ولع؛ شور و شوق','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('117172de-7237-5d23-91de-44c37655fa65','78afc3bc-8e80-5339-b09d-728c47b3b755',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is receiving medical treatment from a doctor or in a hospital',null,null,'بیمار، مریض؛ بیمار (پزشک)؛ بیمار (رنج‌کش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a cancer/AIDS etc patient One in three cancer patients suffers no pain at all.','a heart patient (= one with heart disease ) Some heart patients have to wait between three months and a year for surgery.','a mental/psychiatric patient (= one with problems relating to their mind ) The drug was used in the past to treat mental patients.','a seriously ill/critically ill patient The ward was packed with seriously ill patients.','a hospital patient All hospital patients have to follow a daily routine.','treat a patient (= try to cure their illness or injury ) Patients are treated in terms of priority.','see a patient I stayed in the treatment room while the doctor saw another patient.','examine a patient Can you please wait outside while the physician examines the patient.','a patient receives treatment/a drug Twelve of these patients were receiving treatment with a new drug.','a patient responds to treatment (= starts recovering ) Some patients respond quickly and satisfactorily to treatment.','a patient recovers The treatment succeeded and the patient recovered rapidly.','a patient is admitted (to hospital) This examination should be done when the patient is admitted to hospital.','a patient is discharged (from hospital) (= allowed to leave it ) The patient was discharged after eight days.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d1c55a8a-cede-5082-a587-c1a3af08169f','0b025a8a-adce-5956-ab75-80e375ece0e7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','able to wait calmly for a long time or to accept difficulties , people’s annoying behaviour etc without becoming angry',null,null,'صبور، شکیبا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You’ll just have to be patient and wait till I’m off the phone.","translation":"شما فقط باید صبور باشید و صبر کنید تا من تلفن را قطع کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001584129.mp3"},{"sentence":"Louise was very patient with me.","translation":"لوئیز با من خیلی صبور بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373022.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('57ceaf6e-83ab-5adc-a170-82c627da929b','d48859b5-ad56-54ff-9b9e-1806e5f5925e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the regular way in which something happens, develops , or is done',null,null,'الگو، نقش؛ طرح (بافت)؛ الگو (رفتاری)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a pattern of behaviour It''s easy to get stuck in the same old pattern of behaviour.','a pattern of development Regular checks help to ensure that the child is following the normal pattern of development','the same/a similar pattern Each of the murders has followed a similar pattern.','a different pattern There are different patterns of social life in urban areas.','the basic pattern The basic pattern of her working day rarely changed.','the general pattern The general pattern of change has been one of upward mobility.','the normal/usual pattern As soon as she could, she resumed the normal pattern of her life.','a set/fixed pattern (= one that does not change ) These incidents followed a set pattern.','a weather pattern Rising global temperatures are affecting weather patterns.','a behaviour pattern He studied animal behaviour patterns.','a sleep pattern Disturbed sleep patterns may be a symptom of depression.','a speech pattern Computers are now able to produce acceptable speech patterns.','a spending pattern The bank’s computer can detect unusual spending patterns.','a pattern emerges (= can be seen when something is studied ) Although the numbers are small, a pattern began to emerge.','follow a pattern Her headaches did not seem to follow any particular pattern.','fit a pattern ( also conform to a pattern formal ) (= match a particular pattern ) Last week’s bombing fits this pattern.','establish a pattern You should try to establish a pattern of working that suits you.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Weather patterns have changed in recent years.","translation":"الگوهای آب و هوا در سال های اخیر تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771511.mp3"},{"sentence":"changing patterns of behaviour among students","translation":"تغییر الگوهای رفتاری دانش آموزان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373576.mp3"},{"sentence":"The child showed a normal pattern of development .","translation":"کودک یک الگوی رشد طبیعی نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373577.mp3"},{"sentence":"They noticed patterns in the data.","translation":"آنها متوجه الگوهایی در داده ها شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589474.mp3"},{"sentence":"A general pattern began to emerge .","translation":"یک الگوی کلی شروع به ظهور کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589475.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their descriptions seemed to follow a set pattern (= always develop in the same way ) .","translation":"به نظر می رسید که توصیفات آنها از یک الگوی تعیین شده پیروی می کند (= همیشه به یک شکل توسعه می یابد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589481.mp3"},{"sentence":"His behavior fits a pattern of violent acts.","translation":"رفتار او با الگوی اعمال خشونت آمیز مطابقت دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771513.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
