00373588.mp3"},{"sentence":"a pattern of dots","translation":"یک الگوی نقطه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373589.mp3"},{"sentence":"A sonnet has a fixed rhyming pattern.","translation":"یک غزل دارای یک الگوی قافیه ثابت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373593.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
